Yes and no, there are important gains that come with increased 
experience (Pw, HP, skill slots), but one of the other gains is 
monster-level. Keeping your XL low keeps the monsters easy (making 
it easier for your pet, which gets tougher without its growth 
affecting monster strength), and allows you more time to get gear 
that will help you deal with monsters as your XL (inexorably) 
rises.
I still gain levels too quickly in my games (I think), I'm usually 
about XL7 by the time I reach Sokoban (which I do before tackling 
the mines), and XL 9 through 11 when I reach minetown.

